        "ActivityTitle": "Hyperlink Array",
        "ActivityDes": "Requirements:\\nCommandant Lv.40\\nEvent Info:\\n1. During the event, participate in online matchmaking or team up with friends to take on exclusive event bosses.\\n2. A team consists of 1-3 commandants. Strategically selecting characters and balancing class compositions will make challenges easier to complete.\\n3. This event features two bosses: [Radiant Dragon] and [Nocturne Stalker]. Each boss has multiple difficulty levels. Complete lower difficulties first to unlock higher ones.\\n4. Defeat bosses or sign in daily to obtain equipment. Enhance equipment to boost its power and make your characters stronger.\\n5. If the total equipment level of your deployed characters is below the stage requirement, you cannot join matchmaking or create rooms, but you may still invite friends to form a team and attempt the challenge.\\n6. Clear a difficulty for the first time or complete event missions to earn [Simulation Quantum], which can be used to redeem rewards in the [Quantum Exchange] shop.",
