        "ActivityDes": "Requirements: Commandant Lv.40.\\n\\nEvent Info:\\n1. Invite friends to form a team of 1-3 commandants (solo matchmaking is allowed).\\n2. Upon successful matchmaking, you'll be directly placed into a match with up to 9 commandants, randomly assigned to either the Cats or Rats faction.\\n3. Cats can use charged attacks to capture all Rats to win.\\n4. Rats can disguise themselves within the environment to avoid capture and win by surviving until the match ends.\\n5. Cheese will spawn at designated locations in the environment. Both Cats and Rats can collect cheese to activate powerful skills and gain match advantages.\\n6. Participate in topic competition and daily matches to earn Prestige EXP. Increase Prestige Level and earn rewards in the event!",
